# Keep repository text byte-stable across Windows, macOS, and Linux checkouts.
# rustfmt.toml requires Unix newlines, so relying on each machine's
# core.autocrlf setting makes the Windows CI checkout fail before compilation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# This file is copied byte-for-byte from the pinned Rust sysroot and is hash
# checked as runtime license evidence. Preserve upstream whitespace verbatim.
/release/rust-runtime/COPYRIGHT.html -whitespace
